# 中国网络环境：使用 npmmirror 镜像
# Electron 运行时与 electron-builder（NSIS 等）二进制同样走国内镜像，
# 启动包装器（run-electron.mjs / electron-builder.mjs）会再次兜底这两个变量
registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com
electron_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/
electron_builder_binaries_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron-builder-binaries/
# 原生模块（better-sqlite3 等）按 Node 26 ABI 编译，低版本安装后运行必崩，装前即拦
engine-strict=true
